## Success Criteria

### Code is Production-Ready When:
[X] All linters show 0 errors
[X] Type checking passes
[X] Complexity metrics within acceptable limits
[X] Security scan shows no vulnerabilities
[X] Performance benchmarks meet requirements
[X] Documentation is complete and accurate
[X] Tests cover critical paths
[X] Integration with other components verified

### Warning Signs of Poor Quality:
[X] Linter errors present
[X] Type errors in statically typed languages
[X] High cyclomatic complexity
[X] Security vulnerabilities detected
[X] Poor performance metrics
[X] Missing or inadequate documentation
[X] Low test coverage

## Enforcement

