- CI/CD pipeline quality gates
- Automated security scanning
- Performance regression testing

### Manual Review
- Code review checklist
- Security review for sensitive code
- Performance review for critical paths
- Architecture review for major changes

### Team Standards
- Regular code quality training
- Shared quality metrics dashboard
- Continuous improvement of standards
- Recognition for quality contributions

## OPSEC and Security Considerations

When validating code quality:
- NO production credentials in test data
- NO sensitive information in error messages
- NO hardcoded API keys or secrets
- NO customer data in test cases
- Redact sensitive information in logs and reports

